  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fleet Vehicle Source obligated $447M in FY26 to date. Fleet Vehicle Source recorded 14,915 awards, with an average award size of $30K. Fleet Vehicle Source year-over-year obligations are up 14.3% compared with the prior fiscal-year-to-date total. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations have moved unevenly over the last six fiscal years: FY21 was $182M, FY22 was $232M, FY23 was $474M, FY24 was $256M, FY25 was $391M, and FY26 is $447M. Fleet Vehicle Source current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date obligations rather than full-year totals. Fleet Vehicle Source transaction counts and award-size averages suggest a mix of many small orders alongside larger agreements that drive total obligations. Fleet Vehicle Source provides a clear baseline for contract volume and size that competitors and partners can use for planning and market positioning in the federal fleet vehicle space.",
