      {
        "heading": "How has Fleet Vehicle Source's federal business trended over time?",
        "body": "Fleet Vehicle Source obligations rose from $182M in FY21 to $474M in FY23, then fell to $256M in FY24 before climbing to $391M in FY25 and $447M in FY26 to date. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations are up 14.3% year over year. Fleet Vehicle Source shows variability across fiscal years, with FY23 at $474M as the highest year in the six-year series."
      },
